ou need the same team every week, want strategy as well as editing, or care about a track record on YouTube specifically.</p></div><h2>Hiring on a marketplace: what to expect</h2><div data-block="prosCons"><p>Fast to find someone for a small job Easy to compare portfolios [good point] Quality varies a lot between sellers Fees can add up on long projects [check] [watch-out]</p></div><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><div data-block="faq"><p>Is YT Agencies free? Yes, for businesses and creators. Agencies can pay for a Pro plan; Pro agencies are shown first and always marked with a Pro badge. How much does a YouTube editor cost on these platforms? [Answer from the platforms' public pricing pages, with the date checked.] Freelancer or agency: which should I hire? [Two or three sentences on the trade-off.]</p></div><div data-block="ctaBox"><p>Compare YouTube agencies that edit for channels like yours See starting prices and the niches each agency works in. Free for businesses and creators.</p></div><p>Read more: <a href="/guides">how much a YouTube agency costs</a>.</p>$html$,
